          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.142,
            0.253,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": "**Section 7.1**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.172,
            0.234,
            0.191
          ],
          "content": "**Page no. 152**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.198,
            0.233,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.226,
            0.881,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": "**Q1. Three guavas together weigh 1 kg. If they are roughly of the same size, each guava will roughly weigh \\_\\_\\_\\_kg.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.271,
            0.197,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": "Ans. $\\frac{1}{3}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.31,
            0.882,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": "**Q2. A wholesale merchant packed 1 kg of rice in four packets of equal weight. The weight** of each packet is kg."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.355,
            0.197,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": "Ans. $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.394,
            0.882,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": "**Q3. Four friends ordered 3 glasses of sugarcane juice and shared it equally among themselves. Each one drank \\_\\_\\_\\_ glass of sugarcane juice**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.439,
            0.197,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "Ans. $\\frac { 3 } { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.477,
            0.869,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": "**Q4. The big fish weighs** $\\frac { 1 } { 2 }$ **kg. The small one weighs** $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ **kg. Together they weigh \\_\\_\\_\\_ kg.** Ans. $\\frac { 3 } { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.556,
            0.881,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": "**Q5. Arrange these fraction words in order of size from the smallest to the biggest in the empty box below:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.601,
            0.854,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "**One and a half, three quarters, one and a quarter, half, quarter, two and a half.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.627,
            0.355,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": "Ans. $\\frac { 1 } { 4 } , \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , \\frac { 3 } { 4 } , 1 \\frac { 1 } { 4 } , 1 \\frac { 1 } { 2 } , 2 \\frac { 1 } { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.693,
            0.148,
            0.714
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_36_image_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.693,
            0.253,
            0.715
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Section 7.2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.725,
            0.238,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 154**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.751,
            0.882,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": "**Q. By dividing the whole chikki into 6 equal parts in different ways, we get 1/6 chikki pieces of different shapes. Are they of the same size?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.797,
            0.429,
            0.815
          ],
          "content": "Ans. Yes, they are of the same size."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
